				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-258360#post-4667279</guid>
				<title>Bad Is The Perfect Example of What It Isn&#039;t</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-258360/scp-666-j#post-4667279</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Thu, 28 May 2020 19:43:16 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Parkerson</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>6454731</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Is this SCP bad? Quite the contrary, it is splendid and smartly, and creatively made. I still am wondering, though, how much storming of the brain might you need to come up with such a magnificent piece of&#8230; umm&#8230; artwork. That be the word I was looking for, it is a masterpiece.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
